<details>
<summary>Raw Slither output</summary>

\`\`\`text
[High] arbitrary-send-eth src/vulns/ArbitrarySend.sol:22
ArbitrarySend.sweepFees(address) (src/vulns/ArbitrarySend.sol#22-26) sends eth to arbitrary user
	Dangerous calls:
	- to.transfer(amount) (src/vulns/ArbitrarySend.sol#25)

[High] unprotected-upgrade src/vulns/ParityStyleLibrary.sol:21
ParityStyleLibrary (src/vulns/ParityStyleLibrary.sol#21-46) is an upgradeable contract that does not protect its initialize functions: ParityStyleLibrary.initWallet(address) (src/vulns/ParityStyleLibrary.sol#28-31). Anyone can delete the contract with: ParityStyleLibrary.kill(address) (src/vulns/ParityStyleLibrary.sol#42-45)

[High] reentrancy-eth src/vulns/ReentrantBank.sol:16
Reentrancy in ReentrantBank.withdraw() (src/vulns/ReentrantBank.sol#16-26):
	External calls:
	- (ok,None) = msg.sender.call{value: amount}() (src/vulns/ReentrantBank.sol#22)
	State variables written after the call(s):
	- balances[msg.sender] = 0 (src/vulns/ReentrantBank.sol#25)
	ReentrantBank.balances (src/vulns/ReentrantBank.sol#10) can be used in cross function reentrancies:
	- ReentrantBank.balances (src/vulns/ReentrantBank.sol#10)
	- ReentrantBank.deposit() (src/vulns/ReentrantBank.sol#12-14)
	- ReentrantBank.withdraw() (src/vulns/ReentrantBank.sol#16-26)

[High] unchecked-transfer src/vulns/UncheckedToken.sol:30
UncheckedToken.withdraw(uint256) (src/vulns/UncheckedToken.sol#30-35) ignores return value by token.transfer(msg.sender,amount) (src/vulns/UncheckedToken.sol#34)

[Medium] tx-origin src/vulns/TxOriginWallet.sol:18
TxOriginWallet.transferTo(address,uint256) (src/vulns/TxOriginWallet.sol#18-23) uses tx.origin for authorization: require(bool,string)(tx.origin == owner,not owner) (src/vulns/TxOriginWallet.sol#20)

[Low] missing-zero-check src/vulns/ArbitrarySend.sol:22
ArbitrarySend.sweepFees(address).to (src/vulns/ArbitrarySend.sol#22) lacks a zero-check on :
		- to.transfer(amount) (src/vulns/ArbitrarySend.sol#25)

[Low] missing-zero-check src/vulns/ParityStyleLibrary.sol:33
ParityStyleLibrary.execute(address,uint256,bytes).to (src/vulns/ParityStyleLibrary.sol#33) lacks a zero-check on :
		- (ok,ret) = to.call{value: value}(data) (src/vulns/ParityStyleLibrary.sol#35)

[Low] reentrancy-benign src/vulns/UncheckedToken.sol:24
Reentrancy in UncheckedToken.deposit(uint256) (src/vulns/UncheckedToken.sol#24-28):
	External calls:
	- token.transferFrom(msg.sender,address(this),amount) (src/vulns/UncheckedToken.sol#26)
	State variables written after the call(s):
	- deposits[msg.sender] += amount (src/vulns/UncheckedToken.sol#27)
\`\`\`

